<Placemark>   <name>Steinkreuz Haggenegg</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Cross <b>County/Region:</b> Schwyz <b>Alt Name:</b> Steinkreuz Pilgerkapelle <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>5</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>4</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 47.05141 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 8.68426<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Central_Europe/Switzerland/thumb/20230610130515_IMG_7140.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    Ancient Cross in Schwyz. Stone cross from the 14th or 15th Century. It was excavated here around 1700. A chapel was built above it. In 2010 the chapel was renovated and the cross now has a dignified p...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
		     <a href="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=58199" >Link To More Information</a><br />
                    ]]></description>    <styleUrl>#46_r</styleUrl>   <Point>     <coordinates>8.68426,47.05141,0</coordinates>   </Point>  </Placemark></Folder><Folder><name><![CDATA[Ancient Mine, Quarry or other Industry]]></name><open>0</open>
<Placemark>   <name>Fuorcla da Strem Sut</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Mine, Quarry or other Industry <b>County/Region:</b> Uri <b>Alt Name:</b> Untere Stremlücke <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b>  Access: <b>2</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 46.7311 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 8.7803<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Central_Europe/Switzerland/thumb/WIH_FLs21-725.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    Ancient Mine, Quarry or other Industry in Uri. The retreating Brunnifirn glacier in the Alps of central Switzerland exposed a rock crystal extraction site exploited during the Early and Late Mesolithi...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
